  "html": "<table align=\"right\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"text-align:left; background:rgb(240,240,240); border:1px solid black; width:25%;\">\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center; background:#9999FF; font-size:150%;\"> Awesome Cleavage\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Awesome-cleavage.png\" title=\"Image:Awesome-cleavage.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image:Awesome-cleavage.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/recovered/Awesome-cleavage.png\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\"><hr/>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>Skill Type: </b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\">Passive\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>Trainer: </b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\">Warrior\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>Number of Ranks: </b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\">14\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>Cost to Max: </b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\"><hr/>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\">Powers up the Skill Cleave with additional damage and chance to Knockdown.\n</td></tr></table>\n<p>Augments Cleave skill while in skill tray.  Every time a monster is hit by your Cleave, there is a chance for Gosh's Awesomeness to intervene and augment the cleavage.  This invervention causes  Divine Damage on the target and nearby enemy.  Furthermore, there is a chance that they will be knocked down.  Each augmentation costs Mana.\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n<b>Gosh's Awesomeness may augment Cleave skill, adding X Divine Damage on the target and nearby enemy, possibly knocking them down.  Each augmentation costs Y mana.</b><br/>* Damage listed is at INT = 10 for comparison purposes.\n</p>\n<table align=\"right\" border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"text-align:center; width:100%; background:rgb(240,240,240);\">\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"10%\">Skill Level\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"8%\">1\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"8%\">2\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"8%\">3\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"8%\">4\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"8%\">5\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"8%\">6\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"8%\">7\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\">Req Char Lvl\n</td><td> 35\n</td><td> 40\n</td><td> 45\n</td><td> 50\n</td><td> 55\n</td><td> 60\n</td><td> 65\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\">X*\n</td><td> 135-267\n</td><td> 158-313\n</td><td> 182-359\n</td><td> 205-405\n</td><td> 229-452\n</td><td> 252-498\n</td><td> 275-544\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\">Y\n</td><td> 47\n</td><td> 52\n</td><td> 58\n</td><td> 63\n</td><td> 69\n</td><td> 74\n</td><td> 80\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\">Upgrade Cost\n</td><td> 198842\n</td><td> --\n</td><td> --\n</td><td> --\n</td><td> --\n</td><td> --\n</td><td> --\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"9\"> \n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\">Skill Level\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\">8\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\">9\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\">10\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\">11\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\">12\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\">13\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\">14\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\">Req Char Lvl\n</td><td> 70\n</td><td> 75\n</td><td> 80\n</td><td> 85\n</td><td> 90\n</td><td> 95\n</td><td> 100\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\">X*\n</td><td> 299-590\n</td><td> 322-636\n</td><td> 345-682\n</td><td> 369-729\n</td><td> 392-775\n</td><td> 416-821\n</td><td> 439-867\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\">Y\n</td><td> 85\n</td><td> 91\n</td><td> 96\n</td><td> 102\n<